{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gnmp4jqx","slideIndex":6,"text":"Data source: cBioPortal PDAC MSK 2024 study, pdac_msk_2024. The assignment requires a private GitHub repository, a two-page write-up, a presentation, and a live demonstration. Team member names and SRNs appear on the title slide. Add the team-specific assigned problem statement and individual contribution details when provided.\n\nNested tuning: five-fold outer CV with three-fold inner parameter search by balanced accuracy. MSK tuned results: SVM bAcc 0.661 / AUC 0.675; RF 0.658 / 0.689; NB 0.652 / 0.682; LR 0.650 / 0.692; Gradient Boosting 0.537 / 0.664.\n\nThe results shown here come from the public MSK 2024 CSV, not the synthetic --demo dataset. To reproduce them, use the command on this slide."}